+      iv. Clear `queues[d]` [S3].
+      v. Push the new internal node `p` onto `queues[d-1]` [S3].
+      vi. Decrement `d` by 1 [S3].
+4. After the input stream is exhausted, if `queues[0]` contains the root node, write it to the output [S3].
 
